Return a new right-rotated array without modifying nums. Handle empty arrays before reducing k modulo the length.

```javascript
function solve(nums, k) {
  const n = nums.length;
  if (n === 0) return [];

  const shift = k % n;
  return nums.slice(n - shift).concat(nums.slice(0, n - shift));
}
```

