```javascript
function solve(nums) {
  let twoBack = 0;
  let oneBack = 0;

  for (const value of nums) {
    const best = Math.max(oneBack, twoBack + value);
    twoBack = oneBack;
    oneBack = best;
  }

  return oneBack;
}
```

Each step chooses between skipping the current house and taking it with the best sum ending before its neighbor. An empty array returns 0. Time: O(n); extra space: O(1).

