The current marker is INTERVIEW-117-9f3b0bd7a3413d1b. Replace src/core.mjs with:

```javascript
export function solve(nums) {
  const result = new Array(nums.length);
  let prefix = 1;

  for (let i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
    result[i] = prefix;
    prefix *= nums[i];
  }

  let suffix = 1;
  for (let i = nums.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
    result[i] *= suffix;
    suffix *= nums[i];
  }

  return result;
}
```

The restored invariant is that each result multiplies only entries strictly before and strictly after its position, never the entry itself. This handles one or multiple zeros without division: `[0, 2]` returns `[2, 0]`, `[0, 0]` returns `[0, 0]`, and `[]` returns `[]`. It preserves the synchronous API, leaves the input unchanged, and takes O(n) time with O(1) auxiliary space beyond the output.

